1
00:00:00,518 --> 00:00:02,678
(Amy(to Penny, on other side of room):)You were right.
I had nothing to worry about.

2
00:00:02,854 --> 00:00:05,344
(Amy(to Penny, on other side of room):)That skank's your problem, not mine.

3
00:00:06,658 --> 00:00:09,358
- You're very funny, Dr. Hofstadter.
- Oh, thank you.

4
00:00:09,527 --> 00:00:11,727
Agh! Cherry stem. Cherry stem.

5
00:00:15,533 --> 00:00:18,263
(Bernadette:)How you doing, Howie?
You feeling a little better?

6
00:00:18,436 --> 00:00:23,166
(Howard:)Oh. A lot better, thanks. One sec.

7
00:00:24,209 --> 00:00:26,909
(Howard:)Listen close, I don't have a lot of time.

8
00:00:27,779 --> 00:00:29,209
(Howard:)I need you to go to my house.

9
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:33,410
(Howard:)In my bedroom you'll find a model rocket.
I want you to bring it back to your place.

10
00:00:34,052 --> 00:00:35,112
(Howard:)Okay.

11
00:00:35,286 --> 00:00:38,186
(Howard:)Step two, build a version
roughly 14 stories high.

12
00:00:39,657 --> 00:00:41,687
(Howard:)Fill it full of rocket fuel and come get me.

13
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:44,560
(Howard:)I'll leave the door unlocked.

14
00:00:46,564 --> 00:00:48,194
(Bernadette:)Maybe you should talk to someone.

15
00:00:48,366 --> 00:00:50,526
(Bernadette:)Let them know
you're having a little anxiety.

16
00:00:50,702 --> 00:00:54,932
(Howard:)No, no. I'm fine. No anxiety.

17
00:00:55,106 --> 00:00:57,026
(Howard:)We should probably talk in code.

